# Scene 5: The org chart. The staff room; the cast is gathered.
# Core card; the vote is optional and skipped in short mode.

~ start
Mme Salma: One hundred and ten supervisors on the busy days. They need to know who answers to whom.
do Story.show_exhibit("org_chart")
do Story.show_card(6)
if not GameState.short_mode
	A supervisor finds a candidate with a phone. Who does she report to first?
	- The regional office, directly.
		do GameState.record_vote(5, "A")
		=> wrong
	- The deputy head, following the chart.
		do GameState.record_vote(5, "B")
		do GameState.team += 5
		Aziz: Deputy first. Got it. Writing it on my hand.
	- Whoever is nearest.
		do GameState.record_vote(5, "C")
		=> wrong
=> END

~ wrong
# No cost: story.md's vote rules say a wrong optional warm-up vote costs nothing.
Mme Salma: Then the region hears it before I do, and nobody acts. The chart says\: to me first.
do Story.show_card(6)
=> END
